            "text": " throw is 90 x 100 cm. Each pair of stitches works the second stitch first, then crosses back for the first, creating a large X that reads like a cable across aran-weight yarn."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The long crossed dtr makes a bold geometric pattern. In a natural or cream aran it looks like a classic cable blanket but is worked flat without a cable needle. Total yardage is around 700 g."
          }
        ]
      },
