        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "How to work a crossed dtr pair"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Skip 1 stitch. Work 1 dtr into the 2nd stitch. Without removing hook, work 1 dtr into the skipped stitch, passing the hook in front of the first dtr. Two stitches used, one X made."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
