            "text": "Turning chain"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " of ch 4. *Work crossed-dtr pair across every 2 stitches*. Work 1 dtr into last stitch. Turn. (72 pairs.)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Row 2 and onward"
