      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Ch 4. *Work crossed-dtr pair across every 2 stitches*. Dtr into turning chain. Turn."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Repeat Row 2 until piece measures 100 cm. Fasten off."
